<wpt lat="43.999772" lon="-121.663687"><ele>1935.4</ele><name>Dutchman Flat Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:dutchman-flat-sno-park (OSM way 559496151); OSM Tumalo Mountain Trail #38 starts at the lot; confidence: high; pdf_page: 36; quote: book start: a plowed turn-out on the right side (north) ... shortly before the first Mt. Bachelor access road (not used; see book.note)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.005358" lon="-121.642699"><ele>2370.9</ele><name>Tumalo Mountain summit</name><desc>source: OSM peak node 357317067 (end of Tumalo Mountain Trail #38); confidence: high; pdf_page: 36; book_elev_ft: 7775; quote: Top of Tumalo Mt. - 7,775'; On top of Tumalo Mt. is an open ridge</desc></wpt>
